{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F7]In the [Bbmaj7]land where the [G7]Horites once [Cm7]stood
[F7]Before [Dm7]Esau came [G7]to claim the [Cm7]land [F7]
[Bbmaj7]Lotan and Sho[G7]bal and [Cm7]Zibeon [F7]
[Dm7]Anah and Dis[G7]hon in the [Cm7]sun [F7]
[Bbmaj7]Ezer and Dis[G7]han held the [Cm7]place
[F7]Chiefs [Dm7]of the [G7]clans in the [Cm7]ancient [F7]days
[Bbmaj7]Timna was Lo[G7]tan's sister [Cm7]true
[F7]And [Dm7]Shobal had sons [G7]who bore his [Cm7]name [F7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bbmaj7]Al[G7]van and Mana[Cm7]hath and E[F7]bal
[Dm7]Shepho [G7]and Onam [Cm7]in the [F7]line
[Bbmaj7]These [G7]were the sons of [Cm7]Shobal's [F7]house
[Dm7]Living in the [G7]land of [Cm7]Seir [F7]
[Bbmaj7]A[G7]lyan and Man[Cm7]ahath a[F7]gain
[Dm7]Ebal [G7]and Shephi [Cm7]and On[F7]am
[Bbmaj7]Recor[G7]ded in the [Cm7]book of [F7]days
[Dm7]Part of Edom's [G7]early [Cm7]fame
{end_of_chorus}

