{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F7]The [Bbmaj7]Horite chiefs [G7]held [Cm7]clan by [F7]clan
[Dm7]In the [G7]land of [Cm7]Seir they [F7]dwelt
Be[Bbmaj7]fore the descen[G7]dants of [Cm7]Esau [F7]
[Dm7]Came to take [G7]their in[Cm7]heritance
[F7][Bbmaj7]The geneal[G7]ogy lists [Cm7]them [F7]clear
